"🪨 run solid skill repo=bhuild/role=dispatcher/skill=radio.task.push

🦫 hold up — this task goes to a public repo
   ├─ repo: ehmpathy/rhachet-roles-bhuild-demo (public)
   ├─ the title and body must hold none of
   │  ├─ the source org, repo, route path, or pr / issue numbers
   │  ├─ internal endpoint, service, table or product names
   │  └─ customer, revenue or other business detail
   └─ this push: naught sent, naught queued; once checked, re-run the command below

rhx radio.task.push --via gh.issues --into ehmpathy/rhachet-roles-bhuild-demo --title 'public nudge test <ts>' --description 'acceptance test of the promise gate on a real public repo' --promise task-to-public-repo-is-anonymized"
`;

